  "limitations": [
    "The task set is small and synthetic; inference is limited to these task families.",
    "Knowledge tasks test extraction from supplied text, not broad factual research.",
    "Design pass/fail is a structural HTML proxy, not visual or aesthetic review.",
    "Confidence intervals resample tasks within each category; one completion per arm/task does not estimate generation-to-generation sampling variance.",
    "The route-head's raw success-probability output is not consumed by the current F_expected policy; this measures its category/difficulty effect on route choice.",
    "Weiche route-head initialization is excluded from per-task latency; classifier warm-start is recorded separately. Router per-task latency includes warm classifier routing plus the provider response.",
